{"id":"en_my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me","title":"My Killer Bride Finally Loves Me","titleEn":"My Killer Bride Finally Loves Me","description":"Sold by her own father and left behind by her family, she was handed over to killers and came back hardened into a lethal assassin with one aim: to tear down everyone who wronged her. A forced marriage binds her to a distant billionaire, and the two collide in constant, bitter conflict. Time and again she pulls him out of danger, and against all odds he becomes deeply devoted to her. Yet a dark secret buried in her history threatens to destroy everything they have built. My Killer Bride Finally Loves Me can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Constant Twists","Counterattack","Growth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtutc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtutc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtutc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtutc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-killer-bride-finally-loves-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumbl